+# NME-001 DWO-05 Reproduction Procedure
+
+Status: `COMPLETE_ON_SUCCESSFUL_RELEASE_VERIFICATION`  
+Authority: `NONE`
+
+This procedure reproduces the DWO-05 engineering candidate only. It does not
+authorize real v1.2.1/v1.2.2 execution, provider contact, data acquisition,
+historical-final access, prospective-final access, prediction, alerts, or
+trading action.
+
+## Prerequisites
+
+- Python 3.12 and the repository-pinned `uv`/lock environment.
+- Candidate ZIP, external manifest, and receipt in one directory.
+- No licensed CSV is required for standalone candidate verification or the
+  hermetic sealed reproduction.
+- The three exact registered CSV fixtures are required only for the separately
+  authorized licensed regression and ordinary fixture-present distribution
+  exclusion proof. They must remain outside the candidate.
+
+## Verify candidate and sidecars
+
+```text
+UV_OFFLINE=1 uv run --locked --extra dev python -m nexus_nme001.release_dwo05 verify \
+  --package NME-001-DWO-05_UNREVIEWED_RESEARCH_CANDIDATE.zip
+```
+
+Expected final result: `PASS`, exact sidecar bindings, no authority elevation.
+
+## Reproduce sealed hermetic execution
+
+```text
+UV_OFFLINE=1 uv run --locked --extra dev python -m nexus_nme001.release_dwo05 reproduce \
+  --package NME-001-DWO-05_UNREVIEWED_RESEARCH_CANDIDATE.zip
+```
+
+The reproduced named hermetic cases and full collected inventory must exactly
+match the frozen manifest identities.
+
+Frozen named-test collections:
+
+- hermetic: 922 cases, SHA-256
+  `7baf3ae855cc94a15ca26c484e7b2fb324024b9a6d5fe68262e8f3c9a5e2dc2c`;
+- licensed regression: 983 cases, SHA-256
+  `15138cc5ffc83929e566b1024270cd62e6ec8d70d57c1500cf28763cbd3ea12e`.
+
+The digests bind canonical ordered test names, not JUnit file bytes.
+
+## Independently rebuild the canonical patch
+
+Start from a copy of the candidate source tree in which the target patch path
+is absent, then run:
+
+```text
+UV_OFFLINE=1 uv run --locked --extra dev python -m nexus_nme001.release_dwo05 candidate-patch \
+  --project-root . \
+  --output docs/NME-001-DWO-04_TO_DWO-05.patch
+```
+
+The command uses the exact embedded historical DWO-04 candidate as its sole
+baseline and excludes the patch's self-referential path. The resulting patch
+must reconstruct every governed source/configuration/governance/documentation
+byte.
+
+## Licensed regression and fixture-present build proof
+
+Only in the authorized v1.0.1 licensed-regression lane, after all three fixture
+paths, sizes, hashes, and receipts verify:
+
+```text
+UV_OFFLINE=1 uv run --locked --extra dev pytest -q --licensed-fixtures \
+  --junitxml=pytest_dwo05_licensed.xml
+```
+
+At package start, before the fresh licensed regression, the package command
+performs all three ordinary distribution conditions:
+
+1. no `data/raw` directory;
+2. one hermetic raw sentinel; and
+3. all three exact fixtures at the actual project root.
+
+Each condition builds and scans a wheel and source distribution twice. The
+fixture-present artifacts are deleted in their temporary build directory and
+never become deliverables. Filename, exact-byte, complete-row, bounded raw,
+Base64, hex, cross-member, and nested-archive hits all fail closed.
+The exact in-memory matrix is consumed once by the later candidate-archive
+scan and embedded manifest step; the ordinary builds are not repeated there.
+Controlled actual-root raw-state transitions hold a nonblocking cross-process
+lock; a second process fails before inspecting, moving, or writing `data/raw`.
+Any nonempty raw-state reappearance in the no-raw lane fails closed with a
+bounded canonical lstat inventory of relative paths, kinds, sizes, and
+regular-file SHA-256 identities. The inventory never follows symlinks and has
+no data or authority vote.
+
+Standalone verification validates the sealed fixture-present record. It does
+not claim to repeat licensed byte comparison without separately held bytes.
+
